Tao.

218
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:11,160
Comprei seu sorvete favorito.

219
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:13,640
O de feijão vermelho.

220
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:19,880
Obrigada.

221
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,840
Descanse.

222
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:23,760
Te busco amanhã à noite.

223
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:26,160
Não pode perder o encontro dos ex-colegas.

224
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,240
Xin Zhaozhou,

225
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:30,440
